#: ../../library/pprint.rst:363
msgid ""
"The result can be limited to a certain *depth* (ellipsis is used for deeper "
"contents)::"
msgstr "結果可以限制在特定的 *depth*\\ （更深的內容會以刪節號表示）： ::"

